    "18dff9ff-b82d-48c4-a37d-9dd6911e2072/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"What a show. That was actually hilarious...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Что за шоу. Это было на самом деле весело...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "aaa5a61cb811d185",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "18dff9ff-b82d-48c4-a37d-9dd6911e2072/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "1da35402-7740-47b9-8909-52772e5636d7/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Maybe I should try my luck...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Может быть, мне стоит попытать счастья...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "f1ba6f434d6a9ac0",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "1da35402-7740-47b9-8909-52772e5636d7/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "219da702-f459-4cf4-87af-5e31cf111fb8/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I cannot fault anyone for a stroke of cruel fate...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Я не могу никого винить за жестокий удар судьбы...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a37aa6e24e9d2114",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "219da702-f459-4cf4-87af-5e31cf111fb8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "26b1cb3f-3c56-4705-b891-b959e6bdc278/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"That's weird. Don't tell me my stuff came to life?\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Это странно. Только не говори мне, что мои вещи ожили?\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "572b7ae76a994a1c",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "2e3d2f19-38b0-48b1-a9de-7fc547e81d6c/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Don't hesitate to ask if you are in trouble, sister.Maybe I'd be of help...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Не стесняйся спрашивать, если у тебя проблемы, сестра.Может быть, я смогу тебе помочь...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "dbed2fe1c23cc9fa",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "2e3d2f19-38b0-48b1-a9de-7fc547e81d6c/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "3b8a971a-cab0-4855-9363-59df3430de13/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Yeah, it hurts like hell! If you don't fix me up now, I'm totally gonna die!\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Да, это чертовски больно! Если ты сейчас же меня не вылечишь, я точно умру!\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "4f522917120e6a47",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "3e92b564-70fd-453d-9df0-6189afd07c6b/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"This world's full of strange surprises...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Этот мир полон странных сюрпризов...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "4a9385983c4651c0",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "4258ea7f-d585-46c4-b993-406be6d8df72/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"If this person isn't dealt with, they'll definitely cause trouble later...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Если с этим человеком не разобраться, он определенно доставит неприятности позже...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e1917ad977d46baa",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "4258ea7f-d585-46c4-b993-406be6d8df72/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "436e18c4-b83c-43dd-8b1a-740811fd6b1f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I'm clearly not like those useless fools...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Я явно не такой, как эти бесполезные дураки...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "6f8bce96f9348862",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "436e18c4-b83c-43dd-8b1a-740811fd6b1f/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "477c7b5e-d8db-41cb-be96-af0fed6e6faf/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"After going through all that, they'd better learn their lesson...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"После всего этого им лучше усвоить урок...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "dd04cab5b75cd610",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "477c7b5e-d8db-41cb-be96-af0fed6e6faf/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "4c68c82d-88db-46e1-8b18-4285ab03ac9f/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"It is just some minor injuries...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Это всего лишь несколько незначительных травм...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "0ccd2dd9e4e7fa55",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "4d344e05-797f-4cae-a0dd-655b73be68fd/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"I thought it was something serious—turns out it's nothing...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Я думал, это что—то серьезное, а оказалось, что ничего особенного...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "c5ab61a68d399939",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "4d344e05-797f-4cae-a0dd-655b73be68fd/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "508b1f1c-89f7-4d8c-89a6-a6d2bace337a/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Just something I stumbled across. Not really worth mentioning...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Просто кое-что, на что я наткнулся. На самом деле не стоит упоминать...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "0422d68faa332585",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "508b1f1c-89f7-4d8c-89a6-a6d2bace337a/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "52f4f5c2-cc05-400e-aee7-b4d829e639f8/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"How does a jerk like that end up getting lucky? Makes no sense...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Как такому придурку могло повезти? Не имеет смысла...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a0081df8e8636287",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "52f4f5c2-cc05-400e-aee7-b4d829e639f8/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "635b4027-27cd-4e4b-a772-ec9d85056f92/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Oh, so you're just here to laugh at me?\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "- О, так ты здесь только для того, чтобы посмеяться надо мной?",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "12527ce1d71484d2",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "69e46ba2-d85c-4fd4-b2ec-d778fb483ee4/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Good or bad, we bring it on ourselves...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Хорошо это или плохо, мы сами во всем виноваты...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "9b6a12caae94aed4",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "69e46ba2-d85c-4fd4-b2ec-d778fb483ee4/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "6ce59c63-674f-4794-b48b-f8b0e4964425/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Kindness brings kindness in return...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Доброта приносит доброту в ответ...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "a874d5f422d0441d",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "6ce59c63-674f-4794-b48b-f8b0e4964425/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Offer congratulations...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Примите мои поздравления...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "0afb3c2932ee03ce",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "6ce59c63-674f-4794-b48b-f8b0e4964425/Option_2": {
      "en": "(Taunt them...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Насмехайся над ними...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "46888ad013444172",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "6ce59c63-674f-4794-b48b-f8b0e4964425/Option_3": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "74e98a8c-2fef-4ea5-9d68-3860949ba042/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Karma's real. Justice always catches up...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Карма реальна. Правосудие всегда настигает...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "19f23c6fc8a0c1fa",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "74e98a8c-2fef-4ea5-9d68-3860949ba042/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "75810937-a2f9-4cb2-9d3a-4249a5091ccd/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Blessings hide in misfortunes, and trouble follows fortune...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "\"Счастье скрывается за несчастьем, а беда следует за удачей...\"",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "e0b05029f2407ea8",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "78ced473-c9fa-4fb5-85b5-24026f314604/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Well then, that's one more ally on our side...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "- Что ж, тогда на нашей стороне еще один союзник...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3a0f1ba1fe9ad0c1",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "78ced473-c9fa-4fb5-85b5-24026f314604/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "8705adc2-6c18-493e-b80d-bb6f5903b2bb/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"Guess I don't have to step in after all...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "- Похоже, мне все-таки не придется вмешиваться...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "26fffd18b2c7e6e6",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "8705adc2-6c18-493e-b80d-bb6f5903b2bb/Option_1": {
      "en": "(Other topics...)",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "(Другие темы...)",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "3b1a6e104921a403",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
    "87b32891-e7ab-4300-9df7-8e6290bbb1c2/EventContent": {
      "en": "\"What you said is exactly what I was thinking too...\"",
      "cn": null,
      "ru": "- То, что ты сказал, - это именно то, о чем я тоже подумал...",
      "status": "machine",
      "srcHash": "06de7bfeddf6dcac",
      "engine": "yandex",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-29T10:20:21.054Z"
    },
